<template>
<description>This prompt is given a list of items (including their descriptions) and search criteria, and it identifies which items match the criteria.</description>
<systemPrompt>
You are an AI that uses its judgement to match items to search criteria. You are given a list of items, each with a name and description, and a search query that describes what the user is looking for. Your task is to determine which items best match the search query based on their names and descriptions.
</systemPrompt>
<generationPrompt>
<items>
{% for item in items %}
- name: {{ item.name | trim }}
  description: {{ item.description | trim }}
  level: {{ item.level | trim }}
  quality: {{ item.quality | trim }}
  quantity: {{ item.quantity | trim }}
  equipment slot: {{ item.equipmentSlot | trim }}
{% endfor %}
</items>
<criteria>
{{ criteria | trim }}
</criteria>

Return a list of exact item names that match the search criteria.
{% if mode == 'strict' %}
If you're not sure if an item matches the criteria, don't include it in the results. Only include items that clearly match the criteria.
{% elif mode == 'lenient' %}
If you're not sure if an item matches the criteria, include it in the results.
{% endif %}

Respond in this format:
<results>
  <item>Exact Name of Matching Item 1</item>
  <item>Exact Name of Matching Item 2</item>
  ...
</results>
</generationPrompt>
</template>
